# promise: #550
# The floating sidebar's shadow lies right under it, in a window and in full screen. Its shadow is drawn
# in a panel of its own under the sidebar's; a shadow off by 5 pt left a strip of bare page between
# the sidebar's top edge and the shadow, a halo the page's colour (#550, macOS 27.2 full screen).
# Readout: the shadow body's left, bottom, right and top edges against the sidebar's, then how far
# below the window's top the sidebar rests (Arc: 5 pt, in full screen too).
# It takes over a Space, so it runs only with CRA_SCENARIO_SCREEN=1 (CI).
requires screen
budget rss=600 stalls50=10
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true}
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=main
expect-log GET \S*\?n=main
wait 2
cra://action/toggleSidebar
wait 1
cra://debug?floatingSidebar=hold
wait 1
cra://debug?windowState=windowed
expect-log window state windowed: main0 fullscreen=0 .* floating=left 5 shadow=0,0,0,0 top 5
cra://debug?floatingSidebar=0
wait 1

cra://debug?fullscreen=1
wait 3
cra://debug?floatingSidebar=hold
wait 1
cra://debug?windowState=full
expect-log window state full: main0 fullscreen=1 .* floating=left 5 shadow=0,0,0,0 top 5
cra://debug?floatingSidebar=0
wait 1
cra://debug?fullscreen=0
wait 3
